  "body": "Coastal Living Meets Modern Comfort\r\n\r\nSet within the highly sought-after community of Stanmore Bay, this quality house and land package offers the perfect balance of modern comfort, relaxed coastal living, and everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nDesigned with lifestyle and functionality in mind, this beautifully planned single-level home delivers generous open-plan living, quality finishes, and easy-care modern design in one of the Hibiscus Coast’s most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n3 Spacious Bedrooms\r\n2 Stylish Bathrooms including ensuite\r\nOpen-Plan Kitchen, Dining & Living\r\nDesigner Kitchen with Quality Appliances\r\nSingle Internal Access Garage\r\nAdditional Off-Street Parking\r\nWell-considered single-level layout\r\nSeamless indoor-outdoor flow ideal for entertaining\r\nQuality insulation and double glazing for year-round comfort\r\nProfessionally designed modern coastal aesthetic\r\nDesigned for Easy Modern Living\r\n\r\nThis thoughtfully designed home maximises space where it matters most, creating a warm and inviting environment perfect for professionals, downsizers, first-home buyers, or those seeking a relaxed lifestyle close to local amenities and the coast.\r\n\r\nEnjoy light-filled living spaces, modern finishes, and a practical layout designed to make everyday living effortless.\r\n\r\nPrime Location\r\n\r\nPositioned only minutes from:\r\n\r\nStanmore Bay Beach\r\nCoast Plaza Shopping Centre\r\nCafés, restaurants, and local amenities\r\nSchools and recreational facilities\r\nShakespeare Regional Park and beautiful coastal walkways\r\nBoat ramps and marine activities\r\nNew World supermarket\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of modern living while remaining close to some of the Hibiscus Coast’s most popular lifestyle destinations.\r\n\r\nFlexibility to Suit Your Lifestyle\r\n\r\nThis package also offers flexibility to discuss selected design changes and customisations to better suit your personal preferences, lifestyle needs, and budget requirements (subject to final specifications and pricing).\r\n\r\nThe images provided are indicative examples of the quality and style your future home could achieve.\r\n\r\nContact Pete today to discuss this exciting opportunity and start planning your new lifestyle in Stanmore Bay.",
